    {
      "id": "8c4a09a0c73aa945",
      "text": "UNITED NATIONS, (Sputnik) - Russia expects the new UN secretary-general to represent the interests of all mankind, not just the golden billion, Russian Foreign Minister Sergey Lavrov said on Saturday.",
      "title": "Russia Expects New UN Secretary-General to Represent Interests of All Mankind - Lavrov",
      "url": "https://sputnikglobe.com/20260926/russia-expects-new-un-secretary-general-to-represent-interests-of-all-mankind---lavrov-1124799033.html",
