    {
      "id": "622a641992067bf9",
      "text": "Pursuing the utopian goal of containing Russia, the West destroyed the European security system with its own hands and fostered the Russophobic regime in Kiev, he noted",
      "title": "Lavrov says West destroyed European security system in an attempt to contain Russia",
      "url": "<![CDATA[https://tass.com/politics/2193377]]>",
      "timestamp": "2026-09-26T18:04:26.000Z",
      "extra": {
