        "category": "news"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "1347dd4462da8245",
      "text": "The West increasingly resorts to brute force as it acts unpredictably and recklessly, jeopardizing the life and wellbeing of millions if not billions of people on our planet, Lavrov argued",
