      "id": "0c469c1124b2ec6b",
      "text": "UNITED NATIONS (Sputnik) - In his speech at the 81st session of the UN General Assembly, Russian Foreign Minister Sergey Lavrov commented on the state of global affairs, including the changing world order, the Middle East, Cuba, and the conflict in Ukraine.",
